===========================================================
                       AUTH APIs
===========================================================

01  POST   /api/auth/register
    → PUBLIC / MEMBER REGISTRATION
    → Register new Member

02  POST   /api/auth/login
    → PUBLIC
    → Login Member/Admin

03  POST   /api/auth/logout
    → AUTHENTICATED USER
    → Member/Admin logout

04  POST   /api/auth/refresh
    → AUTHENTICATED USER
    → Refresh JWT access token

05  POST   /api/auth/forgot-password
    → PUBLIC
    → Request password reset

06  POST   /api/auth/reset-password
    → PUBLIC
    → Reset password

07  GET    /api/auth/me
    → MEMBER / ADMIN
    → Get current logged-in user

08  PATCH  /api/auth/change-password
    → MEMBER / ADMIN
    → Change current user's password



